### Get quantumleap health

GET http://localhost:8668/health HTTP/1.1


### krakend - GET list of Entities by Type

GET http://localhost:8081/v1/entities/Device

### iot agent json - Get version

GET http://localhost:4041/version

### iot agent json - Delete device H001

DELETE http://localhost:4061/iot/devices/H001
fiware-service: smartcity
fiware-servicepath: /miniature-house

### iot agent json - delete service

DELETE http://localhost:4041/iot/services?resource=/iot/json&apikey=testApiKey HTTP/1.1
fiware-service: smartcity
fiware-servicepath: /


### iot agent json - delete device


DELETE http://localhost:4061/iot/devices/H001
fiware-service: smartcity
fiware-servicepath: /miniature-house


### scorpio context broker - Test if there are data available

GET http://localhost:9090/ngsi-ld/v1/entities/?type=froggit-wh-4000-se
NGSILD-Tenant: smartcity
NGSILD-Path: /

### scorpio context broker - Remove Entity WS001

DELETE http://localhost:9090/ngsi-ld/v1/entities/urn:ngsi-ld:froggit-wh-4000-se:WS001/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### scorpio context broker - Query contexts

GET http://localhost:9090/ngsi-ld/v1/jsonldContexts?details=true
Accept: application/json


### scorpio context broker - Query hosted contexts

GET http://localhost:9090/ngsi-ld/v1/jsonldContexts?details=true&kind=hosted
Accept: application/json
